Licensing overview

Research materials created for this project are dedicated under CC0 1.0
Universal. The official legal text is in LICENSE-DATA.md. This category
includes the project methodology, protocol, experiment-authored scenarios and
prompts, rubric, researcher-authored tables and results, and documentation, to
the extent the repository owner holds the rights necessary to apply CC0.

Software code in scripts/ and any other clearly identified original source
code is licensed under the MIT License. The official license text is in
LICENSE-CODE.

Model-generated outputs are included as research data. The repository owner
imposes no additional restrictions on their reuse. Their legal status may
depend on applicable law and relevant provider terms. No exclusive copyright
ownership in model-generated output text is asserted by this repository.

Third-party works remain subject to their own rights and terms. Linked research
papers are not redistributed here. Nothing in this licensing overview grants
rights the repository owner does not have.
